sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila cyrtoloma Turing carrier at 4.3 µm (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 88.2/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "At 0 Ma the focal carrier is the nonlinear Schnakenberg pattern calibrated to 4.315 µm (Dv/Du = 18). Linear k_c on the same grid is 3.70 µm. Stripe counts on widths 48–144 px correlate with L/λ_linear at r = 0.9917 (RMSE 0.549). Equal diffusion stays at activator std 0.0021 against 0.580 for the focal run. Simulated neighbours, same dx: buzzatii 8.07 µm, deflecta 6.83 µm, both longer than cyrtoloma. GIF last-frame CV similarity to the vendored plate is 92.8 (640×480, 12 frames). Overall 88.2/100 (faithfulness 87.6, reproducibility 89.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 86, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 823511 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19 (sha256 f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19), spec_fingerprint 9a348d1b6c0648f573bdd67fbb5ddd58de163dee9a214d6c7b1eca5585a2eda8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 9a348d1b6c0648f573bdd67fbb5ddd58de163dee9a214d6c7b1eca5585a2eda8; artifact_sha256: f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_cyrtoloma_specimen.jpg=a274390f57aa205d..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=dbe207001ca2facb..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=bd4d7e6a882797ef..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=6de58dd5861c376c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion conditions and critical wavenumber k_c | Schnakenberg 1979 two-species kinetics | Edwards et al. 2007 Hawaiian picture-wing diversity | Loeschcke, Bundgaard and Barker 1999 buzzatii wing and thorax size reaction norms | Werner et al. 2010 Wingless melanin-spot induction, measured on D. guttifera; reconstructed_in_script: Grid calibration that sets the nonlinear focal wavelength to 4.315 µm | Linear k_c on that grid predicts 3.70 µm and is reported as a different number | Buzzatii and deflecta diffusivity hypotheses; simulated carriers 8.07 µm and 6.83 µm | Gallery spiral used as a frozen long-wave prepattern; transfer_boundary: The 4.3 µm figure is the slot's detail tier, not a published cyrtoloma measurement | Deflecta simulated 6.83 µm versus the 6.05 µm hypothesis; order is preserved, the micrometre is not exact; does_not_claim: That 4.315 µm was measured on this species in the cited papers | That buzzatii is a cladistic ancestor or deflecta a descendant | That the gallery plate is a pinned-adult photograph | That DOI 10.11646/zootaxa.2400.1.1 is about Drosophila cyrtoloma." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: A real CC photograph of a pinned D. cyrtoloma adult is still missing; Commons had none on 2026-10-27.",
            "remediation needed: Deflecta simulated carrier is 6.83 µm against the 6.05 µm hypothesis. The order versus cyrtoloma and buzzatii holds; the micrometre does not.",
            "remediation needed: Signing was not run: ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is absent." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.882"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (Cursor cloud agent, loop 3180 primary assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

